WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.000
This is the home page of Soncaleños, a website about the culture of Cali, Colombia.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The Explorar Cali section is a city guide with places like Cristo Rey and the Cali Zoo.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The Concept Store sells Cali-inspired products and can be filtered by category.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
The Cursos page lists the courses offered on the site.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Users can log in to their account, and the WhatsApp button opens a chat with the team.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:24.100
Back in the city guide, the footer has links to every section of the site.
